{"html":"<header class=\"spec-title-strip\">\n<div class=\"spec-title-col\">\n<div class=\"spec-family-crumb\">\n            FAMILY 07 · <span class=\"lang-zh\">图文对齐与生成式 VLM：开放语义不等于视觉事实</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Vision-Language Models</span>\n</div>\n<h3 class=\"spec-model-title\" id=\"model_101_radfm-title\">RadFM</h3>\n<p class=\"spec-thesis-text lang-zh\">RadFM 的模型特异性在于统一 2D/3D 视觉 encoder 与 Perceiver 扫描聚合，再接生成式 LLM。</p>\n<p class=\"spec-thesis-en lang-en\">Unifies 2D radiographs and 3D volumetric scans (CT/MRI) via a 2D/3D ViT + Perceiver 3D aggregator feeding into a generative radiology LLM.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"spec-tensor-col\">\n<div class=\"tensor-row\">\n<span class=\"tensor-kicker\">INPUT DOMAIN // 输入域</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val lang-zh\">一张或一组 2D 图像、3D CT/MRI 体积及文本指令</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val tensor-val-en lang-en\">Single/multiple 2D radiographs or 3D CT/MRI volumes + natural-language clinical instruction</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"tensor-row\">\n<span class=\"tensor-kicker\">OUTPUT TARGET // 输出目标</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val lang-zh\">放射学自由文本回答、报告或识别结果</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val tensor-val-en lang-en\">Free-text radiology report, VQA answer, abnormality diagnosis, or rationale</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n</header><div class=\"model-full-body\">\n<!-- Main Split: Original Figure Plate (Left) + Forward Computation Graph (Right) -->\n<div class=\"spec-blueprint-grid\">\n<section class=\"spec-figure-plate\">\n<div class=\"plate-header\">\n<div class=\"plate-header-left\">\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">PRIMARY FIGURE // Figure 5(c) · PDF p.12</span>\n<h4 class=\"plate-title\">\n<span class=\"lang-zh\">论文原始架构图</span>\n<span class=\"lang-en\">Original Paper Architecture Diagram</span>\n</h4>\n</div>\n<div class=\"plate-header-right\">\n<a class=\"plate-source-link\" href=\"https://doi.org/10.1038/s41467-025-62385-7\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>SOURCE PDF</span><svg class=\"ui-icon-xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8\"></path></svg></a>\n<button class=\"plate-zoom-btn\" data-call-click=\"openLightbox('architecture_model_101_radfm')\" type=\"button\"><svg class=\"ui-icon\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M15 3h6v6M9 21H3v-6M21 3l-7 7M3 21l7-7\"></path></svg><span>FULLSCREEN LIGHTBOX</span></button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<figure class=\"arch-figure-box\" data-call-click=\"openLightbox('architecture_model_101_radfm')\" title=\"Click to open interactive pan &amp; zoom viewer\">\n<img alt=\"RadFM original paper architecture figure, Figure 5(c)\" class=\"arch-figure-img\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/81901b7907c365072968.avif\"/>\n<figcaption class=\"plate-caption\">CLICK FIGURE TO OPEN INTERACTIVE PAN &amp; ZOOM VIEWER · Figure 5(c) · PDF p.12</figcaption>\n</figure>\n</section>\n<aside class=\"spec-circuit-panel\">\n<div class=\"circuit-header\">\n<div>\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">COMPUTATION GRAPH // 8 STAGES</span>\n<h4 class=\"plate-title\">\n<span class=\"lang-zh\">架构前向计算节点拆解</span>\n<span class=\"lang-en\">Forward Pass Computation Nodes</span>\n</h4>\n</div>\n<div class=\"circuit-controls\">\n<button class=\"circuit-btn\" data-call-click=\"stepArchNode('architecture_model_101_radfm', -1)\" title=\"Previous Stage\" type=\"button\">◁</button>\n<button class=\"circuit-btn circuit-play-btn\" data-play-id=\"architecture_model_101_radfm\" data-call-click=\"toggleAutoPlayNodes('architecture_model_101_radfm')\" title=\"Auto-Trace Computation Graph\" type=\"button\">AUTO</button>\n<button class=\"circuit-btn\" data-call-click=\"stepArchNode('architecture_model_101_radfm', 1)\" title=\"Next Stage\" type=\"button\">▷</button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"active-node-spotlight\" id=\"spotlight-architecture_model_101_radfm\">\n<span class=\"spotlight-badge\">\n                STAGE 01 / 08 · <span class=\"lang-zh\">2D/3D 扫描序列</span><span class=\"lang-en\">2D/3D sequence</span>\n</span>\n<span class=\"spotlight-text lang-zh\">允许不同模态、体积深度、时间点或多图组合</span>\n<span class=\"spotlight-text spotlight-text-en lang-en\">Ingests single/multiple 2d radiographs or 3d ct/mri volumes + natural-language clinical instruction and prepares initial tensor representations (2D/3D sequence).</span>\n</div>\n<ol class=\"circuit-timeline\">\n<li class=\"circuit-node active\" data-node-desc=\"允许不同模态、体积深度、时间点或多图组合\" data-node-desc-en=\"Ingests single/multiple 2d radiographs or 3d ct/mri volumes + natural-language clinical instruction and prepares initial tensor representations (2D/3D sequence).\" data-node-idx=\"0\" data-node-name=\"2D/3D 扫描序列\" data-node-name-en=\"2D/3D sequence\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_101_radfm', 0)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">01</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">2D/3D 扫描序列</span><span class=\"lang-en\">2D/3D sequence</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">允许不同模态、体积深度、时间点或多图组合</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Ingests single/multiple 2d radiographs or 3d ct/mri volumes + natural-language clinical instruction and prepares initial tensor representations (2D/3D sequence).</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"描述任务与问题上下文\" data-node-desc-en=\"Executes Stage 02 to extract primary structural features and establish spatial/sequence encoding.\" data-node-idx=\"1\" data-node-name=\"文本指令\" data-node-name-en=\"Stage 02\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_101_radfm', 1)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">02</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">文本指令</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Stage 02</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">描述任务与问题上下文</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Executes Stage 02 to extract primary structural features and establish spatial/sequence encoding.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"把 2D 图像与 3D 体积编码为可变长度视觉特征\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs encoder within the core unified 2d 3d perceiver radiology mllm computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"2\" data-node-name=\"统一视觉 encoder\" data-node-name-en=\"encoder\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_101_radfm', 2)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">03</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">统一视觉 encoder</span><span class=\"lang-en\">encoder</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">把 2D 图像与 3D 体积编码为可变长度视觉特征</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs encoder within the core unified 2d 3d perceiver radiology mllm computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"跨切片/扫描聚合为固定数量视觉 token\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs Perceiver aggregator within the core unified 2d 3d perceiver radiology mllm computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"3\" data-node-name=\"Perceiver aggregator\" data-node-name-en=\"Perceiver aggregator\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_101_radfm', 3)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">04</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>Perceiver aggregator</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">跨切片/扫描聚合为固定数量视觉 token</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs Perceiver aggregator within the core unified 2d 3d perceiver radiology mllm computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"保留多图和体积上下文后对齐语言空间\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs token within the core unified 2d 3d perceiver radiology mllm computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"4\" data-node-name=\"放射视觉 token\" data-node-name-en=\"token\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_101_radfm', 4)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">05</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">放射视觉 token</span><span class=\"lang-en\">token</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">保留多图和体积上下文后对齐语言空间</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs token within the core unified 2d 3d perceiver radiology mllm computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"联合读取视觉 token 与文本提示\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs Autoregressive LLM within the core unified 2d 3d perceiver radiology mllm computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"5\" data-node-name=\"自回归 LLM\" data-node-name-en=\"Autoregressive LLM\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_101_radfm', 5)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">06</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">自回归 LLM</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Autoregressive LLM</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">联合读取视觉 token 与文本提示</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs Autoregressive LLM within the core unified 2d 3d perceiver radiology mllm computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"2D、3D 与图文任务共享生成目标\" data-node-desc-en=\"Applies multi-task training to project aggregated representations toward the target task head.\" data-node-idx=\"6\" data-node-name=\"多任务放射指令训练\" data-node-name-en=\"multi-task training\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_101_radfm', 6)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">07</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">多任务放射指令训练</span><span class=\"lang-en\">multi-task training</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">2D、3D 与图文任务共享生成目标</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Applies multi-task training to project aggregated representations toward the target task head.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"问答、报告与分类可表达为文本\" data-node-desc-en=\"Produces free-text radiology report, vqa answer, abnormality diagnosis, or rationale via Stage 08.\" data-node-idx=\"7\" data-node-name=\"自由文本响应\" data-node-name-en=\"Stage 08\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_101_radfm', 7)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">08</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">自由文本响应</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Stage 08</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">问答、报告与分类可表达为文本</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Produces free-text radiology report, vqa answer, abnormality diagnosis, or rationale via Stage 08.</span></div></li>\n</ol>\n</aside>\n</div>\n<!-- Mathematical Formalism Band -->\n<section aria-label=\"RadFM Mathematical Formalism\" class=\"spec-math-band\">\n<div class=\"math-meta-col\">\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">MATHEMATICAL FORMALISM</span>\n<div class=\"math-title-text lang-zh\">核心公式 · 二维切片聚合为统一三维扫描条件</div>\n<div class=\"math-title-en lang-en\">Core Formalism · Unified 2D/3D Visual Token Perceiver Aggregation for Generative Radiology LLM</div>\n</div>\n<div aria-label=\"RadFM：核心公式 · 二维切片聚合为统一三维扫描条件\" class=\"tex-formula-vector\" role=\"img\">\n<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" data-formula-index=\"101\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"22.709778pt\" preserveaspectratio=\"xMidYMid meet\" style=\"display:block;width:auto;max-width:100%;height:auto;max-height:96px;margin:0 auto\" version=\"1.1\" viewbox=\"-68.624235 -69.00913 313.617354 22.709778\" width=\"313.617354pt\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><defs><path d=\"M5.637638-1.607918L5.478832-1.687321C5.012337-1.042169 4.754276-.794034 4.327483-.595525C3.960242-.426793 3.285314-.327539 2.530982-.327539C1.975159-.327539 1.746874-.426793 1.746874-.665003C1.746874-.784108 1.856053-1.240677 2.104189-2.114114L2.421802-3.255538L3.195985-3.225761C3.225761-3.225761 3.255538-3.225761 3.275389-3.225761C3.622778-3.225761 3.870914-3.166209 3.970168-3.07688C4.019795-3.027253 4